:[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"compute","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"expected","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"actual","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"buckets","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":" = 10, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"epsilon","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"text":" = 1e-4) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PSIResult","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftStats\/documentation\/SwiftStats\/PSIResult","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10SwiftStats9PSIResultV"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"expected","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Baseline or training reference values."}]}]},{"name":"actual","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Target or validation\/test evaluation values."}]}]},{"name":"buckets","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Number of quantile bins to partition the reference range into (defaults to 10)."}]}]},{"name":"epsilon","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Lower floor applied to each bin proportion independently ("},{"code":"max(p, epsilon)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", default 1e-4) so empty bins give a finite logarithm. The floored proportions are "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" renormalised, so with empty bins the result is an epsilon-stabilised PSI score rather than the exact symmetric (Jeffreys) divergence of two probability distributions."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PSIResult"},{"text":" containing total PSI score, severity rating, and bucket diagnostics.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The metric bins the reference distribution into quantiles and evaluates the divergence","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"across partitions:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"$$\\text{PSI} = \\sum_{i=1}^B (A_i - E_i) \\cdot \\ln\\left(\\frac{A_i}{E_i}\\right)$$","type":"text"}]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Throws","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"code":"SwiftMLError.emptyInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" if either input is empty, or "},{"code":"SwiftMLError.invalidParameter","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" if buckets < 2."}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://SwiftStats/documentation/SwiftStats":{"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"SwiftStats","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiftstats","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftStats\/documentation\/SwiftStats","abstract":[{"text":"Vectorized Statistical Computing & Inferential Analytics.","type":"text"}]},"doc://SwiftStats/documentation/SwiftStats/PopulationStabilityIndex":{"title":"PopulationStabilityIndex","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftStats\/documentation\/SwiftStats\/PopulationStabilityIndex","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Evaluates population drift